# Bakul Endog Design Rules

## Visual system
- Primary color: #1f4e79.
- Accent and warning color: #eab308.
- Page background: #f4f4f5.
- Card background: #ffffff.
- Use sans-serif typography.
- Stock quantities and currency values must be bold and at least 16px.

## Components
- Use a bottom navigation with no more than 5 items.
- Use cards with rounded-xl corners and shadow-sm.
- All interactive buttons must have a minimum height of 48px for comfortable touch use.

## UX requirements
- Show loading states and handle errors for every Supabase fetch.
- Keep forms low-friction with as few taps as possible.
- Display the relevant unit beside every numeric value: butir, kg, or Rp.